	"Description": "[size=4]Meet Sirona, a quirky cave dwelling romanceable NPC with secrets.. this mod is still an active work in progress as I teach myself more about coding and how to make mods.[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=1]There might be some bugs as I am the only alpha tester lmao, but I hope she brings as much joy as I had making her.[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=1][s]She currently has no events because I have no clue how to write them, but she has full marriage dialogue.\n<br />\n<br />[/s]**AS OF MARCH 24TH SIRONA NOW HAS SOME EVENTS!!**[/size]\n<br />\n<br />Let me know what you think so far! Any errors please kindly let me know what they were with as much detail as possible.\n<br />\n<br />Old portraits were made with Poltergeisters and Jazzybees [url=https://jazzybee.itch.io/sdv-creator-masc]portrait maker[/url], and then heavily edited in gimp.\n<br />\u00A0\n<br />New portraits were drawn by me.\n<br />\n<br />[b][size=5]Gift Tastes[/size][/b]\n<br />[spoiler][img]https://staticdelivery.nexusmods.com/mods/1303/images/43386/43386-1785985727-681356827.png[/img][/spoiler]\n<br />\n<br />[line]\n<br />[center]Please do not use AI to translate, or generate any assets for this mod. Thank you[/center]\n<br />",
